title: Choosing our Enemy
subtitle: Decide what the Caucus should fight above all.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_enemy.svg
view-if: enemy_timer <= 0
max-visits: 4
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; enemy_timer = 12; last_card_timer = "enemy"
new-page: true

= Choosing our Enemy

The Caucus cannot fight on every front at once. What should it treat as the greatest threat to the Republic?

- @corruption: Corruption.
- @guilds: The trade guilds and the Banking Clan.
- @militarists: The militarists of the Security Bloc.
- @separatists: The Separatists.
- @overreach: The Chancellery itself.
- @easy_discard

@corruption
subtitle: Everyone's enemy, and therefore nobody's.
on-arrival: main_enemy = "corruption"; corruption -= 1; guild_relation -= 4; mod_relation -= 2; inst_strength += 3

The Caucus declares war on graft. Half the Senate applauds; the other half checks its accounts.

@guilds
subtitle: The Rim will cheer; the guilds will retaliate.
on-arrival: main_enemy = "guilds"; guild_relation -= 10; rim_relation += 5; rimward_strength += 4; rimward_dissent -= 4; guild_embargo += 0.5

The Caucus names the guilds as the root of the Republic's sickness. The guilds hear it.

@militarists
subtitle: The Pacifists approve; the Hawks are furious.
on-arrival: main_enemy = "militarists"; sec_relation -= 8; pacifist_strength += 4; pacifist_dissent -= 4; hawk_dissent += 8

The Caucus warns that a Republic with an army will soon be an army with a Republic.

@separatists
view-if: dooku_movement
subtitle: The Hawks approve; Rim moderates feel abandoned.
on-arrival: main_enemy = "separatists"; cis_relation -= 10; sec_relation += 4; hawk_strength += 4; hawk_dissent -= 5; outer_sep += 2; rimward_dissent += 5

The Caucus declares that secession is treason against the Ruusan constitution.

@overreach
view-if: date >= 21 and not rc_chancellor
subtitle: [? if emergency_powers >= 1 or evidence >= 3 : The danger is real and visible. ?][? if emergency_powers < 1 and evidence < 3 : Many will think we are chasing shadows. ?]
on-arrival: main_enemy = "overreach"; pal_relation -= 8; senate_resolve += 0.5; inst_dissent += 4 if emergency_powers < 1 and evidence < 3; faith -= 0.5 if emergency_powers < 1 and evidence < 3

The Caucus declares that the greatest threat to the Republic is the steady growth of power in the Chancellor's office, whoever holds it.
